  "term": "Ayurveda",
  "definition": "Ayurveda is an ancient Indian tradition described as part of a holistic approach to mental health that brings together physical, mental, and spiritual well-being. In this context, it offers guidance for balanced living, mental peace, and coping with psychological difficulties.",
